    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="de7b16f2-95bb-5d38-9db5-54665378923f" activityNameId="5c2bcc29-4351-5365-a969-711b9014a1f1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Operation, aircraft, freight, Europe</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Operation, aircraft, freight, Europe
Average fuel consumption and emission data caused by an intra European flight. The place of departure is Switzerland. The emissions are given for three subcategories: low poulated are, startosphere and unspecified.;
UUID: 11decf32-182b-37e8-8bc3-b26e574b518a
The invetory includes consumption of kerosene and direct emissions to air (gaseous emissions, particulate emissions, emissions of heavy metals)
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The data is calculated for today"s average aircraft technology
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: na
Sampling: national statistics, publications of environmental agencies, information from aviation companies 
Extrapolations: Swiss data is extrapolated to represent European conditions.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_11decf32-182b-37e8-8bc3-b26e574b518a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
